ns haben ein Auge geworfen auf die monatlichen Goldtransporte einer illegal operierenden Firma und erhalten Verstärkung von Camille, deren Mann im Krieg der Goldgräber erschossen wurde. Tatsächlich erbeutet man beim tollkühnen Coup 600 Kilo Gold, doch dann streikt im entscheidenden Moment der Helikopter. Nun müssen die Sechs die Strecke zur brasilianischen Grenze schwer beladen und zu Fuß zurücklegen. Das wissen auch ihre Feinde.","runtime":100,"posterPath":"/1m8guRPYnqKdGlxKWzj7lHdHidX.jpg","backdropPath":"/jVzREs4AvNJLAg1o01KuRHlb0xK.jpg","cast":[{"id":24891,"name":"Clovis Cornillac","character":"Virgil","profilePath":"/8wokcSilL7u4V8aKcagI7elKsgn.jpg"},{"id":84429,"name":"Audrey Dana","character":"Camille","profilePath":"/8DrYCwpImDoVftSOhcMnb1R7pqH.jpg"},{"id":76339,"name":"Claudio Santamaria","character":"Enzo","profilePath":"/5dTilyM0dEMAV9a8kQbD2X4ehQU.jpg"},{"id":77734,"name":"Bruno Solo","character":"Rémi","profilePath":"/t7Hn92TFs0vwk7EaZ6alFc4APjD.jpg"},{"id":25078,"name":"Ériq Ebouaney","character":"Melchior","profilePath":"/7x8P4IL9DnVlsAB5KFmMB9gfzLX.jpg"},{"id":7275,"name":"Patrick Chesnais","character":"Georges","profilePath":"/g0eY9xGHUCIZBJj0QfxNnZQcH98.jpg"},{"id":549010,"name":"Gérard Klein","character":"Maurice","profilePath":"/uHjX8SLyGOnjc3dyoMbbnpCcsBV.jpg"},{"id":43436,"name":"Mehdi Nebbou","character":"Norris","profilePath":"/udhs2gJxR2CSZwrky6C6s8J0Cke.jpg"},{"id":44560,"name":"Hubert Saint-Macary","character":"Duval","profilePath":"/uSekF3E1h0BfA9PdMcewSBdWee8.jpg"},{"id":82188,"name":"Jean-Pierre Martins","character":"Lionel","profilePath":"/7EwMBrf5zhpyjgbLBdKO8h7nxYS.jpg"},{"id":1355632,"name":"Serge Abattucci","character":"L'homme en pirogue","profilePath":"/jD6TrZkUBNb3FXcGsxYuOi4c5VM.jpg"}],"updatedAt":"2026-11-15T07:35:20Z"},"movie:700391":{"tmdbId":700391,"type":"movie","title":"65","originalTitle":"65","year":"2023","genres":["Action","Abenteuer","Science Fiction"],"voteAverage":5.9,"voteCount":3045,"overview":"Nach einem katastr